fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_drop_no_escape_stage0_duplicate_proofs %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplFact impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropNoEscapeProofRecord Result Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropNoEscapeGateErrorKind StdErrorKind \fact\proof:
